WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.636 --> 00:00:05.805
FINAL NEWS CONFERENCE.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:08.275
RICH EDSON WAS AT THE NEWS

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:08.775
CONFERENCE AND REPORTS FROM THE

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.509
STATE DEPARTMENT.

00:00:08.909 --> 00:00:12.512
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY REX TILLERSON WITH

00:00:09.643 --> 00:00:14.047
ONLY HOURS REMAINING LEADING THE

00:00:12.646 --> 00:00:14.881
STATE DEPARTMENT SAID GOODBYE,

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.917
WARNING OF UNRESOLVED CHALLENGES

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:17.250
IN SYRIA AND WITH CHINA AND

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.085
RUSSIA.

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:21.087
&gt;&gt; RUSSIA MUST ASSESS CAREFULLY

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:23.723
AS TO HOW ITS ACTIONS ARE IN THE

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:24.891
BEST INTERESTS OF THE RUSSIAN

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.325
PEOPLE AND THE WORLD MORE

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.526
BROADLY.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.296
CONTINUING ON THEIR CURRENT

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:32.232
TRAJECTORY IS LIKELY TO LEAD TO

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:33.700
GREATER ISOLATION ON THEIR PART.

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.367
&gt;&gt; TILLERSON DISAGREED WITH

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.902
PRESIDENT TRUMP ON SEVERAL

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:38.004
ISSUES.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.338
RUSSIA, QATAR, THE PARIS CLIMATE

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:40.840
RECORD.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:42.943
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK ANYONE DOUBTS

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:45.278
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE OR THE

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:47.280
COMMITMENT OF THE GOVERNMENT TO

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:48.515
ADVANCING VALUES AND DEFENDING

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:50.250
VALUES.

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.583
THE PRESIDENT SPEAKS FOR

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.319
HIMSELF.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.686
&gt;&gt; PRIMARILY THE IRAN NUCLEAR

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:53.586
AGREEMENT.

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:55.588
THIS MORNING THE PRESIDENT CITED

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.122
IT AS A REASON FOR THE CHANGE IN

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.790
STATE.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.758
AND IN AUGUST, TILLERSON

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:59.326
PUBLICLY ACKNOWLEDGED THEY

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.393
DISAGREED ON IRAN.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:03.363
&gt;&gt; HE AND I HAVE DIFFERENCES OF

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:05.498
VIEWS ON THINGS LIKE JCPOA AND

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:06.099
HOW WE SHOULD USE IT.

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:08.234
WE HAVE DIFFERENCES.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.969
I THINK IF WE ARE NOT HAVING

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:10.203
THOSE DIFFERENCES, I'M NOT SURE

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.671
I AM SERVING HIM.

00:01:10.337 --> 00:01:12.973
&gt;&gt; TILLERSON HAS LOBBIED THE

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:13.506
ADMINISTRATION TO REMAIN IN THE

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.908
IRAN NUCLEAR WOMEN.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:16.309
HIS DATE OF ARTMAN HAS BEEN

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:18.545
NEGOTIATED AND CHANGES TO AROUND

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:22.515
POLICY WITH EUROPEAN ALLIES TO

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:23.483
KEEP THE U.S. AND THE DEAL.

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:25.085
TILLERSON HAS NOMINATED --

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.685
SUCCESSOR MIKE POMPEO IS A

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:28.021
LONGTIME CRITIC OF THE

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:30.890
AGREEMENT.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:38.832
&gt;&gt; MISSILE TESTS, ACTIVITY OF

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:39.699
SHIITE MILITIAS IN -- SHIA

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:41.634
MILITIAS.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.002
THEIR ACTIVITY HAS DRAMATICALLY

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.770
INCREASED.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.871
&gt;&gt; SPECULATION PAGE THAT THE

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.271
PRESIDENT WOULD FIRE TILLERSON

00:01:45.005 --> 00:01:47.707
IN THE FALL.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:49.209
HE STAYED.

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.909
AIDES AT STATE ASSUMED HE WOULD

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.211
REMAIN.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:52.445
CONGRESSIONAL AIDES SAY

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:54.414
RELATIONS WITH CONGRESS IMPROVE.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:55.648
HE TRAVELED MORE AND SPEND A

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:57.250
LITTLE MORE TIME WITH THE PRESS.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:58.651
&gt;&gt; DO YOU BELIEVE THERE'S PEOPLE

00:01:57.384 --> 00:02:00.353
IN THE WHITE HOUSE WHO DON'T

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.121
WANT YOU TO BE SECRETARY OF

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:02.555
STATE?

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:03.590
TO GO I DON'T KNOW.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:04.424
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY TILLERSON CLOSE

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.726
THINKING SENIOR STAFF AND THOSE

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:07.327
WHO WORKED WITH ACROSS THE STATE

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.795
DEPARTMENT AND OTHER

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.296
DEPARTMENTS, ESPECIALLY THE

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.031
MILITARY.

